# The generic scan's decisions (spec 010 FR-005, SC-003). No text from the allowlist is ever printed: a decision
# is named only by allowlist line number and content hash, so reasons cannot reach output.
# A plain line is an email domain the scan accepts: reserved test domains, and the proposed commit identity domain.
# A `blob <object id> <reason>` or `commit <object id> <reason>` line is one decided finding: the scan still prints it.
# A `committer <local> <domain> <reason>` line accepts that exact committer email address (<local> at <domain>)
# when the commit's author and message are otherwise clean.
example.com
example.invalid
selamy.dev
anthropic.com
